  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      466.35,
      296.71,
      496.83
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the LandAcquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the followinglands which are required for a public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.28,
      504.75,
      207.5,
      513.63
    ],
    "text": "Description of the lands to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      521.55,
      296.54,
      595.23
    ],
    "text": "Lot Nos. 1-5 of land allotments in total exetent of about 0.0333Hectare, in the Preliminary Plan No.4152, dated of 30.04.2019 wasprepared by Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of IhalaKaragahamuna, in the Grama Niladari Division of No. 248, IhalaKaragahamuna North in the Divisional Secretary's Division ofMahara, in the Gampaha District in Western Province and bouned asfollows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      605.55,
      296.43,
      657.15
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 1Name of land: Millagahawatta; Description: Garden, A part ofpermanent building; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: K.A.I.Nanayakkara and U. L. D. Jayarathna, No. 72, Ganemulla Road,Kadawatha; Extent: 0.0129 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      667.47,
      296.51,
      719.55
    ],
    "text": "2. Lot No. 2Name of land:Millagahawatta; Description: Garden and apermanent building; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: J. A. D.Sripala, No. 116/4/1, Mangala Mawatha, 6th Croess Road, IhalaKaragahamuna , Kadawatha; Extent: 0.0018 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      308.64,
      413.07,
      548.96,
      453.87
    ],
    "text": "3. Lot No. 3Name of land: Millagahawatta; Description: Garden; Claimant:State; Original Claimant: H. A. Ramani, No. 101, Mangala Mawatha,Ihala Karagahamuna, Kadawatha; Extent: 0.0065 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      308.64,
      460.59,
      548.96,
      501.15
    ],
    "text": "4. Lot No. 4Name of land: Millagahawatta; Description: Garden; Claimant:State; Original Claimant: K.A. D. R. K. Nanayakkara, No. 84/57,Koppiwatta, Kadawatha; Extent: 0.0062 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      308.64,
      507.87,
      548.93,
      549.15
    ],
    "text": "5. Lot No. 5Name of land: Millagahawatta ; Description: Garden and part of aTransfomer ; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: K. A. N. J. Nanayakkara,No. 84/37, Koppiwatta, Kadawatha; Extent: 0.0059 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      308.64,
      555.87,
      548.94,
      641.55
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required toappear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, beforeme at Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office of Mahara on the 21 May 2019at 9.00. a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing(in duplicate) on or before the13th May 2019 the nature of theirinterests in the land, the particulars or their claims for compensationfor the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation andthe details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.879112243652344
    ]
